{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "043S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$(G, m)$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$a : G \\times_B X \\to X$", "MATH_0005": "$G$", "MATH_0006": "$X$", "MATH_0007": "$B$", "MATH_0008": "$G$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0011": "$(\\mathcal{F}, \\alpha)$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0014": "$\\alpha$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{O}_{G \\times_B X}$", "MATH_0016": "$$\n\\alpha : a^*\\mathcal{F} \\longrightarrow \\text{pr}_1^*\\mathcal{F}\n$$", "MATH_0017": "$\\text{pr}_1 : G \\times_B X \\to X$", "MATH_0018": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n(1_G \\times a)^*\\text{pr}_2^*\\mathcal{F} \\ar[r]_-{\\text{pr}_{12}^*\\alpha} &\n\\text{pr}_2^*\\mathcal{F} \\\\\n(1_G \\times a)^*a^*\\mathcal{F} \\ar[u]^{(1_G \\times a)^*\\alpha} \\ar@{=}[r] &\n(m \\times 1_X)^*a^*\\mathcal{F} \\ar[u]_{(m \\times 1_X)^*\\alpha}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{O}_{G \\times_B G \\times_B X}$", "MATH_0020": "$$\n(e \\times 1_X)^*\\alpha : \\mathcal{F} \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{F}\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{equation-action}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-equivariant-module}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fb47ef60a3931a92f70cc55000d80427198f3caceab7d37a7e4e1892b6fd61dd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b7b32fe0ef8edbde8d9521b9e5ad1c4db309768ed8250da669d4d1e72d722214", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a group algebraic space over <MATH_0003>, and\nlet <MATH_0004> be an action of <MATH_0005>\non the algebraic space <MATH_0006> over <MATH_0007>.\nAn <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0008>-equivariant quasi-coherent <MATH_0009>-module<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>,\nor simply a <TEXTITOPEN_0002>equivariant quasi-coherent <MATH_0010>-module<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>,\nis a pair <MATH_0011>, where <MATH_0012> is a quasi-coherent\n<MATH_0013>-module, and <MATH_0014> is a <MATH_0015>-module\nmap\n<MATH_0016>\nwhere <MATH_0017> is the projection\nsuch that\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> the diagram\n<MATH_0018>\nis a commutative in the category of\n<MATH_0019>-modules, and\n<STRUCT_0003> the pullback\n<MATH_0020>\nis the identity map.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nFor explanation compare with the relevant diagrams of\nEquation (<REF_0002>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7655ad1ac71a579d5fc76bede6f8afc4b6a30ba1c459fada0202a064cea5de25", "unit_id": "tag:043T:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "043S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(e \\times 1_X)^*\\alpha$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9201c6a9d4c6062c10a6aa002110f4f5cae211905b829ee085e4f1ae34e4b05a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c9a32601360055d2414db257262a874489bdb726d4c789c2baba6d58274f995b", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nNote that the commutativity of the first diagram guarantees that\n<MATH_0001> is an idempotent operator on <MATH_0002>,\nand hence condition (2) is just the condition that it is an isomorphism.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:750859ee8e2a3cf491b932a0b685b4794691a396561c76aec2eb33a535d21cbe", "unit_id": "tag:043S:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "043S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$G$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$G$", "MATH_0006": "$B$", "MATH_0007": "$G$", "MATH_0008": "$f^*$", "MATH_0009": "$(\\mathcal{F}, \\alpha) \\mapsto (f^*\\mathcal{F}, (1_G \\times f)^*\\alpha)$", "MATH_0010": "$G$", "MATH_0011": "$Y$", "MATH_0012": "$G$", "MATH_0013": "$X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-pullback-equivariant}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c9a868223be334db913a90b1949bc1ba6cd45a563c8133f00c8e80cdce1e9130", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ee917d69c77ef24741c3302e8d70fd2c08375e3188f5bdabbdb52c12e7cc3848", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a group algebraic space over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a <MATH_0005>-equivariant morphism between\nalgebraic spaces over <MATH_0006> endowed with <MATH_0007>-actions.\nThen pullback <MATH_0008> given by\n<MATH_0009>\ndefines a functor from the category of quasi-coherent <MATH_0010>-equivariant sheaves\non <MATH_0011> to the category of quasi-coherent <MATH_0012>-equivariant sheaves on <MATH_0013>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:86a0d87041f980863624765169ba4133adc955c1d012c0b0a186cf9d88feed50", "unit_id": "tag:043U:statement"}
